        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that Ahah, his son, did obtain the kingdom; and he did reign over the people all his days. And he did do all manner of iniquity in his days, by which he did cause the shedding of much blood; and few were his days.",
