        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 11:10",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And Ethem, being a descendant of Ahah, did obtain the kingdom; and he also did do that which was wicked in his days.",
